Read `AGENTS.md` before writing or editing code.

- All submitted code is written in the official window (Tue 10 Nov 2026 12:00 EAT to Wed 11 Nov 2026 12:00 EAT). Do not paste pre-hackathon project code into this repo.
- Do not modify `data/raw/`. Cite `data/raw/DATA_DICTIONARY.md`.
- Do not commit secrets or `.env` files.
- Do not invent dataset facts, metrics, or clinical claims. Label synthetic results. Never claim transfusion release or compatibility decisions.
- Do not present starter-data findings as facts about real Kenyan facilities.
- Recompute evaluation numbers in-window. Do not reuse unverified pitch figures.
- Prefer the contracts in `docs/API_SPEC.md` and the state machine in `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Commit incrementally. Do not push, open GitHub issues, or contact people unless a human approved that specific action.
